WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.993
Pronunciation and Accent.

2
00:00:02.273 --> 00:00:06.070
Day 14 of the Soft Skill Playbook course, in the English phase.

3
00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:08.844
The key idea.

4
00:00:09.124 --> 00:00:11.257
Today's goal: be clearly understood.

5
00:00:11.537 --> 00:00:13.180
You don't need to lose your accent.

6
00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:19.967
Clear pronunciation, the right word stress and a steady pace matter far more than sounding British or American.

7
00:00:21.317 --> 00:00:22.170
Part 1.

8
00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:23.751
What actually matters.

9
00:00:25.001 --> 00:00:25.919
Step 1:

10
00:00:26.199 --> 00:00:29.975
Pace: slow down; most accent problems are speed problems.

11
00:00:30.255 --> 00:00:31.172
Step 2:

12
00:00:31.452 --> 00:00:33.671
Word stress: stress the right syllable:

13
00:00:33.951 --> 00:00:35.764
DE-ve-lop-er, de-VE-lop.

14
00:00:36.044 --> 00:00:36.961
Step 3:

15
00:00:37.241 --> 00:00:40.740
Clear consonants: finish your words: asked, world, first.

16
00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:41.980
Step 4:

17
00:00:42.260 --> 00:00:44.820
Sentence stress: stress the important words:

18
00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:46.679
The release is on FRIDAY.

19
00:00:46.959 --> 00:00:47.919
Step 5:

20
00:00:48.199 --> 00:00:51.889
Specific sounds: v or w, th, and vowel length.

21
00:00:53.239 --> 00:00:54.114
Part 2.

22
00:00:54.394 --> 00:00:57.274
Word stress: common words developers get wrong.

23
00:00:58.524 --> 00:00:59.868
Here is a quick table:

24
00:01:00.148 --> 00:01:03.156
Word, and Stress, and Word, and Stress. developer.

25
00:01:03.436 --> 00:01:04.972
Stress: deVELoper.

26
00:01:05.252 --> 00:01:06.404
Word: company.

27
00:01:06.684 --> 00:01:07.473
Stress:

28
00:01:07.753 --> 00:01:09.545
COMpany. develop.

29
00:01:09.825 --> 00:01:11.276
Stress: deVELop.

30
00:01:11.556 --> 00:01:12.708
Word: hotel.

31
00:01:12.988 --> 00:01:14.929
Stress: hoTEL. analysis.

32
00:01:15.209 --> 00:01:16.809
Stress: aNALysis.

33
00:01:17.089 --> 00:01:18.369
Word: analyst.

34
00:01:18.649 --> 00:01:19.439
Stress:

35
00:01:19.719 --> 00:01:21.340
ANalyst. architecture.

36
00:01:21.620 --> 00:01:22.409
Stress:

37
00:01:22.689 --> 00:01:23.884
ARchitecture.

38
00:01:24.164 --> 00:01:25.337
Word: process.

39
00:01:25.617 --> 00:01:26.407
Stress:

