00:01:26.687 --> 00:01:28.543
PROcess. determine.

41
00:01:28.823 --> 00:01:30.615
Stress: deTERmine.

42
00:01:30.895 --> 00:01:32.132
Word: photograph.

43
00:01:32.412 --> 00:01:33.201
Stress:

44
00:01:33.481 --> 00:01:35.551
PHOtograph. photography.

45
00:01:35.831 --> 00:01:37.452
Stress: phoTOGraphy.

46
00:01:37.732 --> 00:01:38.884
Word: category.

47
00:01:39.164 --> 00:01:39.953
Stress:

48
00:01:40.233 --> 00:01:42.089
CATegory. comfortable.

49
00:01:42.369 --> 00:01:43.159
Stress:

50
00:01:43.439 --> 00:01:45.209
COMF-ter-ble (3 syllables).

51
00:01:45.489 --> 00:01:46.769
Word: vegetable.

52
00:01:47.049 --> 00:01:47.839
Stress:

53
00:01:48.119 --> 00:01:50.273
VEJ-ta-ble (3 syllables).

54
00:01:50.553 --> 00:01:51.407
Wednesday.

55
00:01:51.687 --> 00:01:52.476
Stress:

56
00:01:52.756 --> 00:01:53.673
WENZ-day.

57
00:01:53.953 --> 00:01:55.148
Word: colleague.

58
00:01:55.428 --> 00:01:56.217
Stress:

59
00:01:56.497 --> 00:01:57.500
COL-league.

60
00:01:58.850 --> 00:01:59.725
deploy.

61
